<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">2TƐ - Bible Iyansi</book>
  <para style="h">2 TƐSALƆNIKÀ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Un'kaan wàyweel akà Bàtɛsalɔnikà</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 TƐSALƆNIKÀ</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Tɛ</para>
  <para style="mt2">Un'kaan wàyweel akà</para>
  <para style="mt1">Bàtɛsalɔnikà</para>
  <para style="imt">Nsɛmà</para>
  <para style="ip">Un'kaan a Pɔl wàyweel akà Bàtɛsalɔnikà afuurà ndaa bàtɛn uboo a un'kaan wàtàtwɛb: ngyeel a Mwol unsà làkoo. Ntɔn bàmbɔɔn bàfàkyey uyɔl naa ngyeel ayi yàkyàkwo itaan, un'kaan awà akwen mudwa an'kyän an'be amà.</para>
  <para style="is">Kiin a ndaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Asànaa unsà un'kaan wàtàtwɛb, Pɔl, Silàvɛ anà Tumàtɛ ban'pà mbɔr akà baar ban'söön ba un'kaan 1.1-2.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wa wàŋakab mbwo yweel: Mbwo yàtàtwɛb yàŋàyaamà unsà ngyööb. Yà nsɛmà, nde asɔnà iköŋ a ngwal, itàkal naa mpay a nkwaaŋ: nde an'tüüb anà an'lɔŋ unsà ntsuul a ndaa a Nzam taaŋ usàmɛnà Mwol Yɛsu. Ikal kyàyweel ikanà làkwikilà a aklistɔ ntɔn muyöb balàbal a « ilä a Mwol » anà muyilɔn. Mbwo yàyweel yà ndaa mupà ngwal. Mbwo yà ntsüü yà ntɔn mbɔr a Pɔl anà musà kɔɔ. Un'kaan wàyweel wà akà Bàtɛsalɔnikà ntsüü awa, yà balàbal asànaa un'kaan wàtàtwɛb. Nde wa kàsön ntsü a mbul 51 itàkal 52 utaaŋ abi là. Wa kàläb mbwo nsil ya ayà kun'kaan wàtàtwɛb. Mbeel ayi yà ntɔn bi iduub mii anà iyamà Nzam awà Taaràbi: « Itsuuŋ bi unsube » (Màtay 6.13).</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbɔr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1"/>Pɔl, Silàvɛ anà Tumutɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TH 1:1">Bi ban'pà mbɔr akà Ikööŋ akyà kyà Taa Nzam anà kyà Mwol Yɛsu Klistɔ: <verse eid="2TH 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2"/>Wɛy Taaràbi Nzam anà Mwol Yɛsu Klistɔ bàlapɛ kab a ngway anà duu!<verse eid="2TH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsaŋ mpal usàyà Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3"/>Atɔŋ, taaŋ lanswà bi ikyer afuur an'tɔɔn akà Nzam ntɔn bɛ. Yubwaŋ naa bi ikyer abun, ntɔn làkwikilà abɛ làmuyɛl mbɔɔn, anà ukwen a umwɛy umwɛy uboo a bɛ akatɔŋ bumwɛy bàsöönà. <verse eid="2TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4"/>Kyakin ifàswaŋ bi ngaal uboo a Ikööŋ a Nzam ntɔn muküünà abɛ anà làkwikilà abɛ unsà nkwaaŋ anà mpay aŋàdiir làmanà bɛ.<verse eid="2TH 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5"/>Abà ya ikamɛɛyà ntsüül a nsaŋ a Nzam yàbalàbal, ntɔn bɛ làmɛnà bàŋàkwo ntɔn Imwol a Nzam akyà làmanà bɛ mpay. <verse eid="2TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6"/>Ya yà balàbal naa Nzam ufuur ngyɛb aŋàdiir akà baar bàfàlapà unkiiŋ, <verse eid="2TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7"/>anà nde afàpà, akà bɛ baar làmanà mpay, ngyɔ̈ɔ̈r anà akà bi, umpal a imɛɛy a Mwol Yɛsu fà du anà akyeey ande bunkaak a ngwal. <verse eid="2TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8"/>Nde asàyà uboo a làlem a mbaa ntɔn mupà ntaaŋàmbar akà baar mpa bàyöb Nzam anà mpa bàfàkyey Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ a Mwol abi Yɛsu. <verse eid="2TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9"/>Ntaaŋàmbar aba isàkal bwà a mbul a in'tye, ukwɛl kusà a Mwol anà làkoo ande làngwal, <verse eid="2TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10"/>mpal usàyà nde muwal làkoo amu aŋin'kyɛɛl ande anà itääŋ amu aŋàlàkwikilà, kyekà bɛ làkyey imbäl abi. <verse eid="2TH 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11"/>Kyakin bi ikayamà taaŋ lanswà ntɔn bɛ, ntɔn Nzam abi kàlabuul bàŋàkwo mukal uboo a mbeel kàlasi nde, anà, u mbwo a ngwal ande, nde kàlabay mukwey ngyal abɛ mukyer ubwaŋ anà làkwikilà làfàmɛnà unsà isal. <verse eid="2TH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12"/>Abun, bɛ làsàsyaŋà ikɔb a Mwol abi Yɛsu anà nde sye akyer asàlasyaŋà, asànaa làkwen kab a ngway a Nzam abi anà là Mwol Yɛsu Klistɔ.<verse eid="2TH 1:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Umbarà a ntsüü</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1"/>Atɔŋ, ntɔn ndaa iler ngyeel a Mwol abi Yɛsu Klistɔ anà nköŋ abi apà nde, bi kàmàlalɔɔm: <verse eid="2TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2"/>isàkal naa imɛɛy mwɛy kyàngɔɔm, itàkal ndaa a mbuur mwɛy, itàkal ndaa a un'kaan mwɛy bàmɛɛy naa yàfü akà bi, yàmàlakyään naa ilä a Mwol kyà kyàyà itaan, twon lan'düül musà lingyoomà unsà an'kyän abɛ itàkal muman bɔɔmà ntɔn ya. <verse eid="2TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3"/>Wɛy akà mbuur mwɛy ukɔ̈ɔ̈n akàlabwiy ndwaŋ, itàkal kaben. Ntɔn kusà a ilä aki muyà, baar mbɔɔn bàtwab atàpiy làkwikilà anà aŋufur a nkyɛl awà un'kyàbwà, utwab atàmɛnà, <verse eid="2TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4"/>nde mbuur afàmbarà anà afàmbäär undiir wanswà bàfàbel naa nzam itàkal naa undiir wanswà bàfàsà làkoo. Nde afàkàbwaay tii u ndwà a Nzam anà mukyään nde ŋakwo naa nde wà Nzam. <verse eid="2TH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5"/>Nkye bɛ làfàkayɔbà anki naa mɛ kàkyàlakyään ndaa ayin utaaŋ kàkäl mɛ tsütsü apà bɛ? <verse eid="2TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6"/>Apanà, bɛ làkyàyöb undiir akun'taa mpi ntɔn nde uyàmɛnà nà utaaŋ kàyöŋà Nzam ntɔn nde. <verse eid="2TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7"/>Ntɔn ngyee a ube yàkyàsɛmà musal. Yan'sal nà mulwom mbuur akataa wa mpi, <verse eid="2TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8"/>apan mbuur un'be waa usàmɛnà, mbuur usàdwa Mwol Yɛsu u mbwo a un'swey a mun ande, anà asun'buul undiir a bunàbun u mbwo a in'nyääŋ a ngyeel ande. <verse eid="2TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9"/>Mbuur un'be asàyà u ngwal a Satanà, nde asàkyer isal a ngwal byifà ifà, impà, idiim a loor, <verse eid="2TH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10"/>anà mbwo yanswà mpa ayà balàbal ntɔn mukur baar bàdiimà mbwo, ntɔn ba bàwɛl anki ukwen a ndandaa abà bàlawiiy mɔ̈ɔ̈. <verse eid="2TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11"/>Kyakin Nzam katöömà nde ngwal a ndiimà ntɔn ba bàsi làkwikilà u ndaa a loor, <verse eid="2TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12"/>ntɔn baar banswà mpa bàsi làkwikilà amu ndandaa, wɛɛ bàmɛn un'sak ntɔn ndaa mpa ayà balàbal, bàwɛl ntaaŋàmbar.<verse eid="2TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛ bàlasɔ̈ɔ̈l ntɔn muwà mɔ̈ɔ̈</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13"/>Atɔŋ, akà bi, bi ikyer afuur an'tɔɔn akà Nzam taaŋ lanswà ntɔn bɛ, nkween a Mwol, ntɔn Nzam kàlasɔ̈ɔ̈l fà nsɛmà, ntɔn bɛ làwü mɔ̈ɔ̈ u mbwo a Dweelà afàkyɛɛl anà u mbwo a làkwikilà amu ndandaa. <verse eid="2TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14"/>Ntɔn ya sye, nde kàlabel u mbwo a Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ kàlakyään bi, ntɔn bɛ làwɛl kab unsà làkoo a Mwol abi Yɛsu Klistɔ. <verse eid="2TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15"/>Kyakin, atɔŋ, làkäl aŋàtsim anà làkäär an'lɔɔŋ kàlapɛ bi, itàkal u mun, itàkal unsun'kaan.<verse eid="2TH 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16"/>Wɛy Mwol abi Yɛsu Klistɔ nde ŋakwo, anà Taaràbi Nzam, awà kikwen, anà u mbwo a kab a ngway ande, kipɛ ndɛɛl a mbul a in'tye anà làkyän aŋàbwaŋ, <verse eid="2TH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17"/>bàlalɛɛl anà bàlapɛ ngwal amu isal kyanswà anà ndaa aŋàbwaŋ yanswà.<verse eid="2TH 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Làyamà ntɔn bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1"/>Abun, atɔŋ, làyamà ntɔn bi, ntɔn ndaa a Mwol ipää agyägyä, anà ya iwɛl làkoo asànaa iwà ya akà bɛ, <verse eid="2TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2"/>ntɔn bi isɔrà akaŋankyɛl anà akà baar abe, ntɔn ba banswà làkwikilà latɛy. <verse eid="2TH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3"/>Wɛɛ Mwol wà lää: nde ayàlapà ngwal anà ayàlatii ukwɛl a Mbuur un'be. <verse eid="2TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4"/>Bi ifàsà mpem akà Mwol ntɔn bɛ, ntɔn bɛ làfàkyer indiir ifàlaswaŋ bi, anà bɛ làsàlalà mukyer bya.<verse eid="2TH 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5"/>Wɛy Mwol ulɔ̈ɔ̈n mpem abɛ ntɔn mukwen Nzam anà unsà nkääŋ a mpem a Klistɔ!<verse eid="2TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndöŋ a isal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6"/>Atɔŋ, bi bàmàlaswaŋ kà ikɔb a Mwol Yɛsu Klistɔ: làkäl ukwɛl a un'tɔŋ awe anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ a ŋingyäy anà mpa afàlab an'lɔɔŋ làwɛl bɛ akà bi. <verse eid="2TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7"/>Bɛ, bɛ ŋakwo làkyàyöb ubwaŋ naa bɛ bi lilab aben: bi kàkäl anki anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ a ŋingyäy uboo a bɛ. <verse eid="2TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8"/>Bi kàdi anki mampà a mbuur màngway, wɛɛ, unsà mpay anà ngyɔ̈ɔ̈n, u mpib anà u mwäänà, bi kàsäl ntɔn mukɔɔn akal buur akà umwɛy uboo a bɛ. <verse eid="2TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9"/>Iswaŋà anki naa bi kàkäl anki anà ikɔ̈b muwal mbaay abɛ, wɛɛ bi kàkwen mukal mban lan'kwo bɛ mulab. <verse eid="2TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10"/>Kyakin, mpal kàkäl bi akà bɛ, bi kàlapɛ nswɛɛŋ yi: « Mbuur mpa akwen musal, wɛy nde ukɔɔn adyà sye! »<verse eid="2TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11"/>Kyekà, bi iweemà naa uboo a bɛ bye anà abwal, isal aba nà uyibilà u ndaa a baar asin. <verse eid="2TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12"/>Akà abwal aban, bi kan'pà nswɛɛŋ anà ndɛɛl yi kikɔb a Mwol Yɛsu Klistɔ: wɛy ba bàsäl unsà duu anà badi isaa a mpay aba ŋakwo. <verse eid="2TH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13"/>Akà bɛ, atɔŋ, twon làn'yɔn mukyer ubwaŋ. <verse eid="2TH 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14"/>Isàkal naa mbuur uläb anki nswɛɛŋ kan'pà bi uboo a un'kaan wà, lun'syebà ubwaŋàbwaŋ, twon lan'kal un'tüüb anà nde, ntɔn nde umɛn nswɛn. <verse eid="2TH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15"/>Wɛɛ, twon lun'wɛl asànaa un'yiiŋ, lun'weey asànaa un'tɔŋ.<verse eid="2TH 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsaak anà mbɔr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16"/>Wɛy Mwol a duu, kàlapɛ duu nde ŋakwo taaŋ lanswà anà u mbwo yanswà. Wɛy Mwol ukäl anà bɛ banswà.<verse eid="2TH 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17"/>Mbɔr yi yan'kɔɔ amɛ ŋakwo Pɔl. Mɛ in'fàsà kɔɔ unsà un'kaan umwɛy umwɛy in'fàsɔn mɛ.<verse eid="2TH 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18"/>Wɛy kab a ngway a Mwol abi Yɛsu Klistɔ làkäl anà bɛ banswà.<verse eid="2TH 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3"/>
</usx>
